# Hooks and nets are compared BYTE-FOR-BYTE against their installed copies
# (templates/global/_ritual_test.mjs fails closed on drift). core.autocrlf
# would rewrite the working tree to CRLF while the committed blob stays LF,
# which false-fails that check on every fresh checkout. Pin them to LF.
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js  text eol=lf
